{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"examples/path-02-local-session.path.jsonl","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:26:43.424863Z","id":"395652024dd8f573fed36856477cc3e71eba54eeb37f59e23de15e8aa320fa39","body":{"detail":"Pinned in crates/toolpath/tests/jcs.rs::committed_jsonl_examples_match_their_json (KNOWN_DIFFERENT); the other committed pairs match.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1},"end":{"line":1},"content_hash":"6772ee5f1108fa5fe50282d5aac6e04580be9f648e6ca78273daeb61a6f41e41"},"suggested_fix":"Add \"ref\":\"def789abc123456\" to the PathOpen base and drop it from KNOWN_DIFFERENT.","summary":"This .path.jsonl is not the same document as its .path.json twin: PathOpen has no base.ref (def789abc123456), so a signature over one would not verify against the other","tags":["examples","jsonl","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
